        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>PDQ 3100-BCPA Light Commercial Door Closer</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThe American Eagle 3100 Series by PDQ is a rack and pinion closer featuring a cast aluminum body with a round style arm assembly. Hydraulic control is achieved through separate non-critical sweep, latch and backcheck valve adjustments.  \r\n</p>\r\n<p>American Eagle 3100 Series door closers are non-handed, and tri-packed for regular, top jamb or parallel arm applications.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Package complete with fasteners for wood or metal doors and frames. Sex nuts and bolts are also furnished standard. Common 9-1/6\" x 3/4\" mounting hole pattern.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe 3100 is listed by U.L./U.L.C., complies with UL 10C and UBC 7-2 (1997) for positive pressure and is certified to ANSI A156.4 Grade 1.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features:</b> for PDQ American Eagle 3100 Door Closer\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adjustable closing speed</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable latching speed</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Back Check</li>\r\n<li>Cast  Aluminum Alloy Shell</li>\r\n<li>Closer Body Length: 9-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Horizontal Mounting Holes: 9-1/6\"</li>\r\n<li>Vertical Mounting Holes: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Weight: 258 lbs</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Size: 48\" interior / 42\" exterior</li>\r\n<li>Non Handed</li>\r\n<li>Grade 1 (Highest Grade)</li>\r\n<li>UL 10C Approved, UL US Listed 63Z0</li>\r\n<li>Spring Size: Adjustable from 3-6</li>\r\n<li>Tri packed for regular, top jamb or parallel arm mounting</li>\r\n<!-- <li>Optional Hold Open and Door Saver Arms</li> -->\r\n<li>5 Year Manufacture Warranty</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AE-3100.pdf?v=1704262223\" target=\"new\"><b>PDQ 3100 Install Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A full line of <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=American Eagle 3100\"><b>Door Closer Accessories for PDQ American Eagle 3100 Series</b></a> is available.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\n<table width=\"600\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#990000\" cellpadding=\"2\"\r\ncellspacing=\"0\" class=\"special-items-table\">\r\n<tr height=\"30\">\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n    <span class=\"h-green\">Optional Closer Arms for 3100\r\nSeries</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"200\" height=\"24\">\r\n<a href=\"/products/friction-hold-open-arm-for-american-eagle-3100-pdq-999002\">Friction Hold Open Arm</a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"200\">\r\n<a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-door-saver-arm-for-american-eagle-3100-pdq-999005\">Heavy Duty Door Saver Arm</a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"200\">\r\n<a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-hold-open-arm-for-american-eagle-3100-pdq-999016\">Heavy Duty Hold Open Arm</a>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/friction-hold-open-arm-for-american-eagle-3100-pdq-999002\"> <img  src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AE-319002_195.gif\" border=\"0\" width=\"195\" height=\"218\" alt=\"Friction Hold Open Arm for American Eagle 3100\"></a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-door-saver-arm-for-american-eagle-3100-pdq-999005\"> <img  src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AE-319005_195.gif\" border=\"0\" width=\"195\" height=\"218\" alt=\"Heavy Duty Door Saver Arm\"></a>\r\n<br>Parallel Arm Mount Only\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-hold-open-arm-for-american-eagle-3100-pdq-999016\"> <img  src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AE-319016_195.gif\" border=\"0\" width=\"195\" height=\"218\" alt=\"Heavy Duty Door Saver Hold Open Arm\"></a>\r\n<br>Parallel Arm Mount Only\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</p>\r\n -->\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in Aluminum or Dark Bronze finish.\r\n</p>",
